  "decision_rule_frozen_before_each_replay": [
    "Frozen before replay (2026-10-25 ~00:20 UTC).",
    "Candidate C = --max-fixed-anchor-age 5 --max-fixed-doppler-consensus 3",
    "              --low-ratio-guard-threshold 1e9 --low-ratio-min-fixed-ambiguities 10",
    "(i.e. reject AR candidates fixing < 10 DD ambiguities; hold path unchanged).",
    "N=10 was chosen AFTER inspecting Trimble Odaiba/Shinjuku diagnostics (wrong AR median 6 pairs,",
    "correct 14-19). Trimble results are therefore development evidence only.",
    "Holdout: rover_ublox.obs of both drives (never used in this investigation), same base/nav/reference/argv.",
    "Goal-specific check: libgnss++ FIX inside the hero clip (Odaiba TOW 273700-273720) with FIX error <= 0.5 m.",
    "Default-adoption gate vs default recipe on every run (Trimble + u-blox): wrong FIX >0.5/2/3 m must not",
    "increase; baseline-correct FIX loss <= 1%; missing and horizontal P95 must not increase;",
    "recovery P95 / censoring must not increase. No retuning of N after seeing any result.",
    "",
    "Amendment (frozen before running C2, after seeing C on Trimble): C left 51/52 Odaiba wrong FIX on the hold",
    "path, which rounds unmatched pairs without validation. C2 = C + --hold-fix-unchanged-set (existing opt-in).",
    "C and C2 both go to the u-blox holdout unchanged. Default-correct loss of C on Trimble was 63/1298 (4.9%).",
    "",
    "Round 2 (frozen 2026-10-25 before running D/CD): exceedsFixHistoryJump compares a kinematic candidate with the",
    "stationary last FIX (0.2 m) and rejected 96-100% correct candidates (GT-labelled offline, median 4-8 cm error).",
    "D  = default + --fix-history-motion-compensation (last FIX + latest Doppler velocity * dt; both <= 2 s old).",
    "CD = C + --fix-history-motion-compensation. Same gate vs default on Trimble and u-blox; hero clip must show",
    "continuous FIX without the FFF. pattern. No tolerance (0.2 m) or bound (2 s) is tuned."
  ],
